Objection.js
https://github.com/Vincit/objection.js

Sustained uses Objection.js names and conventions for models and relations,
such as relationMappings, modelClass, the relation type names, joinRelated,
and withGraphFetched. Some README and test examples follow the Objection.js
relation guide.
