Knex.js
https://github.com/knex/knex

Sustained uses Knex.js names for query builder methods, such as the whereIn,
whereBetween, whereExists, whereNull, and whereRaw families, andOn and orOn,
and onConflict with merge and ignore. One test example follows the Knex.js
query builder guide.
